+! Modified for FCEA3LAB (2026-10-04), an unofficial redistributable build:
+!   - CEA2-style interactive mode when started without arguments
+!   - thermo.lib/trans.lib are also searched next to the executable
+!   - banner and database paths are reported on the console and in the .out file
